    "mf-auto-2191": "NC3 Creation (Connector cutting only)",
    "mf-auto-2192": "Separate all connector-related processes into a new NC file. Two NC files will be created: Bar milling (NC1) and Connector cutting (NC2).",
    "mf-auto-3035": "Please unlock the STL calculated just now. (Shortcut: Ctrl + L)",
